Here are some famous world music artists from around the globe:

**Africa:**

1. Fela Kuti (Nigeria) - Afrobeat legend and activist
2. Youssou N'Dour (Senegal) - Grammy-winning singer and politician
3. Angélique Kidjo (Benin) - Singer-songwriter and UNICEF Goodwill Ambassador
4. Baaba Maal (Senegal) - Singer and guitarist known for his soulful voice
5. Ali Farka Touré (Mali) - Legendary blues guitarist and singer

**Asia:**

1. Ravi Shankar (India) - Sitar virtuoso and composer who introduced Indian classical music to the West
2. Ali Akbar Khan (Bangladesh/India) - Sarod master and composer
3. Kyu Sakamoto (Japan) - Singer and actor who sang the hit song "Sukiyaki"
4. Seo Taiji (South Korea) - K-pop pioneer and musician
5. Fazil Say (Turkey) - Pianist and composer who blends classical and folk music

**Latin America:**

1. Antonio Carlos Jobim (Brazil) - Composer and pianist who popularized bossa nova
2. Celia Cruz (Cuba) - Queen of Salsa and Afro-Cuban music
3. Atahualpa Yupanqui (Argentina) - Legendary folk singer and guitarist
4. Rubén Blades (Panama) - Singer-songwriter and salsa musician
5. Elis Regina (Brazil) - Singer who was a key figure in the Brazilian music movement of the 1960s and 1970s

**Middle East:**

1. Fairouz (Lebanon) - Legendary singer and actress known as the "Queen of Arabic Music"
2. Oum Kalthoum (Egypt) - Iconic singer and actress who was a symbol of Arabic music
3. Natacha Atlas (Egypt/Belgium) - Singer who blends Arabic and electronic music
4. Khaled (Algeria) - Singer and songwriter known as the "King of Raï"
5. Sezen Aksu (Turkey) - Singer-songwriter and producer who has influenced Turkish pop music

**Europe:**

1. João Gilberto (Portugal/Brazil) - Singer and guitarist who helped popularize bossa nova
2. Goran Bregović (Bosnia and Herzegovina) - Composer and musician who blends folk and rock music
3. Yann Tiersen (France) - Composer and musician known for his eclectic and cinematic sound
4. Vangelis (Greece) - Composer and musician who scored the soundtrack for "Chariots of Fire"
5. The Chieftains (Ireland) - Traditional Irish music group that has collaborated with artists from around the world

These are just a few examples of the many talented world music artists out there. I hope you enjoy exploring their music!
